{
  "format": 2,
  "uuid": "40f34815-ae6e-4549-bf0e-a54bb293ca59",
  "name": "Add-on board for Raspberry Pi",
  "description": "A 65 mm wide add-on board for the Raspberry Pi 40-pin GPIO header, full size (65 x 56) or micro (65 x 30), built from the Raspberry Pi HAT and uHAT mechanical drawings (BSD-3-Clause). The SMT header option adds 0.5 mm to the height. Full size can carry the display notch and camera slot. The 2 x 20 socket is on the bottom, with a mirror-numbered Footprint so that its pads keep the Pi's pin numbering. Each M2.5 hole has a 6.2 mm copper Keepout. This is not a HAT or HAT+: those names need the Raspberry Pi specification's other requirements. The host board outline is approximate, after the Raspberry Pi 5 mechanical drawing. Raspberry Pi is a trademark of Raspberry Pi Ltd.",
  "category": "Raspberry Pi",
  "suggested_layers": 2,
